+/*
+ * WFDXCompat launcher runtime loader helpers
+ *
+ * WineForge-Internal: wfdxcompat-runtime-loader-v1, here backed by the Mullion (DXMT) runtime
+ * instead of D3DMetal, which does not exist on arm64 hosts.
